# Windsurf Rules — Freerouting C++ Migration

## Project
Freerouting Java → C++20 PCB autorouter migration. Java is source of truth. Goal: headless routing (DSN → route → SES).

## Session Start
Read `SOURCE_OF_TRUTH/01_MEMORY.md` for architecture and `SOURCE_OF_TRUTH/05_WORK_PACKAGES.md` for tasks.

## Build
```bash
cmake --build build --target <module_target> -j$(nproc)
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

## Rules
1. Java `src/**/*.java` = reference implementation
2. 4 files per class: `.h`, `.cpp`, `_test.cpp`, `.java`
3. C++20: smart pointers, RAII, `std::optional`, `#pragma once`
4. PascalCase classes, snake_case functions, `_` trailing private members
5. `freerouting_core` has no dependencies (leaf lib)
6. `Components.h/.cpp` is dead code — never use it
7. Java nets are 1-based

